1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,500
Are you really dating Reo?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,050
What?

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,610
You two went on a date?!

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,610
Please explain this.

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,190
Actually, we're...

6
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,380
You should just tell them.

7
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,480
You two went on a date.

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,400
Yeah. It was a punishment date.

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,720
- A punishment date?
- That's right.

10
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:29,970
They were playing a game with me and Kitauchi.

11
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:32,920
Reo and Kasumi lost,

12
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:35,420
so we thought up a funny punishment.

13
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,230
And that's how they end up going on a date.

14
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:40,290
That makes sense. I knew it couldn't be real.

15
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:43,710
- Right? I thought it was totally impossible!
- Absolutely!

16
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:45,730
No way, you guys totally believed it!

17
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,840
No way!

18
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,060
Better to keep it quiet, right?

19
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:53,140
It's pretty embarrassing.

20
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:57,720
There's no way I'd date someone with so little sex appeal.

21
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:01,520
Be grateful I went on a date with you, even if it was a punishment.

22
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,530
Let's practice.

23
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:18,930
<i>[Ai-Chan's Secret | Episode 10]</i>

24
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,740
Takumi!

25
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:25,460
You surprised me! What's up?

26
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:29,540
Thanks for covering for me.

27
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:33,070
It seemed like Reo wanted it to come out, though.

28
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:35,610
Well...

29
00:01:35,610 --> 00:01:37,870
But...

30
00:01:37,870 --> 00:01:42,190
Reo says he'll wait for me to feel ready.

31
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:46,880
And will he be so soft on you forever?

32
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:50,970
You prioritize your own feelings over his, don't you?

33
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:55,590
Which means he's still not number one to you.

34
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:58,240
Of course he's number one!

35
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,590
Ai, what's wrong?

36
00:02:14,990 --> 00:02:17,220
I think...

37
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:21,020
I've been putting myself first in everything.

38
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:27,010
I don't have the courage or confidence

39
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:30,470
to say I'm Reo's girlfriend.

40
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:38,670
I'm jealous.

41
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:41,220
Jealous?

42
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:43,170
Of what?

43
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:51,140
No matter what, Reo thinks of you and stands by you.

44
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:55,550
And even though you have doubts, you always do your best to think of Reo, too.

45
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:58,490
I think that's wonderful.

46
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,900
You're not alone, Ai.

47
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:06,730
Reo accepts every part of you.

48
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:12,930
Thank you.

49
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,520
I'm sorry.

50
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:27,710
It was terrible of me to go along with Takumi's lie.

51
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:30,300
I'm sorry, too.

52
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:35,380
I tried to do the thing you wanted least in the world.

53
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:37,140
No...

54
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,430
I'm not perfect, either.

55
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:47,720
Even though I know how you feel, I got jealous of Takumi

56
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:50,430
and made you worried about Yuka.

57
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:54,440
We'll face more challenges in the future,

58
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,090
but we can overcome them together, right?

59
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,850
Right.

60
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:08,680
<i>[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

61
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:22,810
What was that about today?

62
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:26,530
- I was just trying to help.
- Who told you to do that?

63
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:30,260
What were you going to say, then?

64
00:04:32,150 --> 00:04:35,740
Kasumi didn't seem ready for that.

65
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,940
You act like you're helping, but what are you planning?

66
00:04:39,940 --> 00:04:44,370
Nothing. Her meddling has just changed.

67
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:49,850
I guess... It's her last gamble.

68
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:57,030
Christmas Eve, huh?

69
00:04:57,030 --> 00:04:59,470
But we have an exam before then, don't we?

70
00:04:59,470 --> 00:05:02,490
Oh, crap! I totally forgot about that.

71
00:05:02,490 --> 00:05:07,350
So I told Dad I wanted him to let us to stay in Japan...

72
00:05:08,810 --> 00:05:12,740
but he said no.

73
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,780
There's nothing we can do.

74
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:19,100
Are you really okay leaving things with Ai like this?

75
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:21,810
We won't be in Japan come the new year!

76
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:27,540
I want to give it everything I've got one final time.

77
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:33,200
I don't want to be apart from Reo.

78
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:39,200
I don't want to transfer schools.

79
00:05:49,550 --> 00:05:51,750
<i>[Kafuu High]</i>

80
00:05:56,450 --> 00:05:59,110
Morikawa? You don't have cleaning duty, right?

81
00:05:59,110 --> 00:06:03,130
It won't hurt, will it? Working together.

82
00:06:03,130 --> 00:06:04,940
Thank you.

83
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:13,680
My blackboard eraser seems to like you, too.

84
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,770
What are you talking about?

85
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:38,410
Those two didn't tell us they were changing schools.

86
00:06:38,410 --> 00:06:43,410
We've been through a lot, but we all became friends, huh?

87
00:06:43,410 --> 00:06:45,240
Kasumi?

88
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,740
Do you have a second?

89
00:06:57,860 --> 00:07:00,160
Oh? Where is Aiko?

90
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,550
Well...

91
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:13,150
Reo, there's something I want to talk to you about.

92
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:16,290
Sorry, I'm in a bit of a rush.

93
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:24,360
If you go on dates as punishment,

94
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:27,010
please go on one with me too!

95
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:28,510
What are you talking about?

96
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:30,810
I'm transferring schools.

97
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,930
Takumi is too.

98
00:07:37,150 --> 00:07:39,060
Reo...

99
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:43,810
I like you.

100
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,980
I really like you.

101
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,440
At first,

102
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:57,530
I just wanted your attention and dug my heels in.

103
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,820
But...

104
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:02,930
at some point,

105
00:08:02,930 --> 00:08:05,750
my feelings became real.

106
00:08:06,290 --> 00:08:08,980
I couldn't do anything to stop it.

107
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:17,900
So this is my final request.

108
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:27,360
I love looking at the sky like this by myself.

109
00:08:28,990 --> 00:08:32,580
But you're here with me today.

110
00:08:37,610 --> 00:08:39,370
Morikawa...

111
00:08:40,990 --> 00:08:42,920
Kiss me.

112
00:08:46,470 --> 00:08:48,080
Morikawa...

113
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:52,150
- I'm sorry.
- Don't tell me you're sorry.

114
00:08:57,070 --> 00:08:59,530
Just say my name...

115
00:09:00,810 --> 00:09:04,320
and hold me one last time.

116
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:17,220
Ikumi...

117
00:09:18,890 --> 00:09:20,750
Thank you.

118
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:43,950
Look at that!

119
00:09:47,450 --> 00:09:50,670
Oh! Mt. Fuji is so beautiful!

120
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:57,130
I really

121
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:59,990
do like you.

122
00:10:20,310 --> 00:10:22,720
You would let me kiss you?

123
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:33,200
This isn't like you at all.

124
00:10:44,750 --> 00:10:47,290
You heard, didn't you?

125
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:49,670
That we're changing schools.

126
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:54,860
Were you trying to help me make one final memory?

127
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,820
I'm sorry.

128
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:59,460
I didn't mean to do that.

129
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:02,520
Why are you making her cry?

130
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:06,590
He didn't! It's my fault!

131
00:11:06,590 --> 00:11:09,920
Reo… I'm sorry.

132
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:14,050
That's enough. Let's go.

133
00:11:49,470 --> 00:11:52,230
I want to tell everyone that you're mine,

134
00:11:52,230 --> 00:11:54,390
Aiko...

135
00:11:55,990 --> 00:11:58,640
That I'm the only one who can touch you.

136
00:12:00,070 --> 00:12:01,910
Reo...

137
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:06,760
Aiko...

138
00:12:08,070 --> 00:12:10,460
Don't let go of my hand.

139
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:25,000
I'm home.

140
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,180
Oh, Aiko! Your friend stopped by.

141
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:30,770
Ranji took her up to your room.

142
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:33,880
Hiroko?

143
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,270
Ikumi?

144
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:54,280
You're really Mai, aren't you?

145
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,770
Yeah...

146
00:12:57,770 --> 00:13:01,550
Was it fun for you to lie and trick me?

147
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:06,010
The person Reo cherished was someone like you.

148
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:07,780
I'm disappointed.

149
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:11,190
I want my tears back.

150
00:13:12,330 --> 00:13:14,880
I feel bad about this.

151
00:13:20,340 --> 00:13:22,610
Why would you do something like this?

152
00:13:25,190 --> 00:13:27,790
Do you not have any confidence or something?

153
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,800
If you have no self-confidence,

154
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:36,210
you're denying the feelings of those who say they love you.

155
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:40,490
I'm not like Takumi.

156
00:13:40,490 --> 00:13:44,630
If you're not going to do it, I'll tell everyone about this myself!

157
00:14:43,830 --> 00:14:45,710
Are you okay?

158
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:53,230
I'm sorry about yesterday.

159
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:58,990
I took advantage of your kind heart.

160
00:15:07,090 --> 00:15:09,810
I do like you, Takumi.

161
00:15:09,810 --> 00:15:11,630
But...

162
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:14,880
it's different than how I like Reo.

163
00:15:16,430 --> 00:15:18,260
I know.

164
00:15:20,150 --> 00:15:22,580
On the roof,

165
00:15:22,580 --> 00:15:27,500
I wasn't trying to help you make memories.

166
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:32,320
I was just sad.

167
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:40,720
Because you and Ikumi...

168
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:45,440
are my precious friends.

169
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:53,350
That's more like the Kasumi I love.

170
00:15:58,570 --> 00:16:01,390
♫ <i>What awaits in this battle of love?</i> ♫

171
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:04,310
♫ <i>It seems it won't end in a draw</i> ♫

172
00:16:04,310 --> 00:16:07,320
♫ <i>You hated loosing,</i> ♫

173
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:11,340
♫ <i>So I won't let you go easy on me</i> ♫

174
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:14,530
<i>[Aiko Kasumi]</i>

175
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:16,840
<i>If you have no self-confidence...</i>

176
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:21,020
<i>you're denying the feelings of those who say they love you.</i>

177
00:16:22,510 --> 00:16:24,380
<i>I want to openly date you as "Aiko".</i>

178
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:28,190
<i>And that's what I can't stand. It's too embarrassing. How could I tell everyone?</i>

179
00:16:28,190 --> 00:16:34,720
<i>Aiko, let's keep this all a secret, until you're ready to tell everyone...</i>

180
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:38,000
<i>that you're "Mai".</i>

181
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:40,210
<i>This is Kasu— </i>

182
00:16:40,210 --> 00:16:44,250
<i>Mai Toda. She is my girlfriend.</i>

183
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:47,320
<i>I don't like you because you're Mai.</i>

184
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:50,880
<i>The one I like is Aiko Kasumi.</i>

185
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:53,590
<i>I want to tell everyone that you're mine, </i>
<i>♫Like a wave coming back.♫ </i>

186
00:16:53,590 --> 00:16:56,180
<i>Aiko...</i>

187
00:16:56,180 --> 00:17:01,050
♫ <i>I'll steal you away before anyone gets the chance</i> ♫

188
00:17:01,050 --> 00:17:03,170
♫ <i>Lips to exchange</i> ♫

189
00:17:04,730 --> 00:17:06,660
Exams are over.

190
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:08,790
What are you going to do for Christmas?

191
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,700
I...

192
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:21,380
- want to put an end to this secret.
- Huh?

193
00:17:23,870 --> 00:17:27,010
At first, I became Mai on a whim,

194
00:17:27,010 --> 00:17:31,290
but, before I knew it, I started to have fun when I was Mai.

195
00:17:31,290 --> 00:17:33,380
But

196
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:36,170
I don't want to hide...

197
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:39,610
my feelings for you anymore.

198
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:44,390
I don't think I'm worthy of being your girlfriend.

199
00:17:44,390 --> 00:17:47,390
Everyone might make fun of me.

200
00:17:47,390 --> 00:17:50,120
I didn't have any confidence.

201
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:53,100
But... you've given me

202
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:55,910
so much confidence, Reo.

203
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:03,040
I don't want to hurt you anymore.

204
00:18:03,870 --> 00:18:07,880
So... I'll tell everyone.

205
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:10,140
I'll quit Spica,

206
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:12,900
and I'll openly

207
00:18:13,970 --> 00:18:16,180
date you, Reo.

208
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:21,280
Really?

209
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:23,590
Are you sure?

210
00:18:25,570 --> 00:18:27,210
Yeah.

211
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:30,680
The number one person to me

212
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:34,740
is you, Reo.

213
00:18:51,630 --> 00:18:55,300
<i>Merry Christmas!
[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

214
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:02,420
- Here you are.
- No way! Thanks!

215
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:06,010
Spica's special dish… mini hamburgers.

216
00:19:06,010 --> 00:19:08,820
<i>Merry Christmas!</i>

217
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,050
Cheers!

218
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,640
So yummy!

219
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:18,000
- And Santa's here!
- In the flesh!

220
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:21,480
Sorry about this. Borrowing Aiko on Christmas Eve.

221
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:24,090
You don't feel bad at all, do you?

222
00:19:24,090 --> 00:19:26,330
But you know, she looks like she's having fun.

223
00:19:26,330 --> 00:19:28,910
Eat up! There you go.

224
00:19:28,910 --> 00:19:30,730
She does.

225
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,230
But you've got a good eye!

226
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:38,590
You really drew out Aiko's inner traits.

227
00:19:39,570 --> 00:19:44,640
Girls can look different with makeup and clothes,

228
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:47,870
but Ai has overcome a lot and has really changed.

229
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:51,170
It's all thanks to you, Reo.

230
00:19:51,170 --> 00:19:55,070
- Order up.
- Got it!

231
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:57,540
Looks good!

232
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:03,270
I hope we can always keep playing games together!

233
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:04,630
Oh! Thank you, Master!

234
00:20:04,630 --> 00:20:07,160
- Merry Christmas!
- Merry Christmas!

235
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:09,330
I'll keep coming next year to see you.

236
00:20:09,330 --> 00:20:12,540
- Absolutely, I will!
- That's great!

237
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:16,310
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

238
00:20:16,310 --> 00:20:19,380
- Take a look!
- Oh? I can open it?

239
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:20,880
Here you are!

240
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,440
It looks so good!

241
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:24,380
Here you go, Master.

242
00:20:24,380 --> 00:20:27,500
- Kasumi is not here yet?
- No, not yet.

243
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:29,100
Someone text her.

244
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:31,130
Do you know it?

245
00:20:31,130 --> 00:20:33,610
I don't.

246
00:20:33,610 --> 00:20:36,000
You go ahead.

247
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:38,090
Excuse me!

248
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:44,480
Everyone, please listen.

249
00:20:49,490 --> 00:20:51,420
Actually...

250
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:58,790
Aiko Kasumi is...

251
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:05,080
Oh! Aiko said her stomach hurts, and she's not coming!

252
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:07,240
What?

253
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:10,170
Now we'll have Kenji's Magic Show!

254
00:21:10,170 --> 00:21:12,290
- No way!
- Awesome!

255
00:21:12,290 --> 00:21:15,010
- Kenji! Kenji!
- For real?

256
00:21:15,010 --> 00:21:17,950
Kenji! Kenji! Kenji!

257
00:21:17,950 --> 00:21:21,960
Okay, okay, I'll do it!

258
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:25,660
All right! Here I go.

259
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:31,530
You don't have to tell everyone.

260
00:21:31,530 --> 00:21:34,930
- What are you talking about?
- Things are fine as they are.

261
00:21:34,930 --> 00:21:39,570
Those feelings make me more than happy enough.

262
00:21:39,570 --> 00:21:41,750
But that's—

263
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:47,760
I'm the only one who can know everything about you.

264
00:21:51,050 --> 00:21:53,870
Is it a good thing

265
00:21:54,710 --> 00:21:56,550
to continue the secret?

266
00:21:57,290 --> 00:21:59,880
It doesn't matter

267
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:02,190
if it's good or bad.

268
00:22:03,420 --> 00:22:09,340
What matters more than anything is you smiling.

269
